        "status": "partially_modelled",
        "description": "Permission that applies despite 900.1.10(3) and 900.1.10(4)(A): a detached houseplex, semi-detached houseplex, townhouse or apartment building is permitted in the R zone if it complies with the R zone regulations and all other requirements of the By-law, or is authorized by a Section 45 minor variance. The building type permission is evaluated; compliance with all other regulations is the rest of the evaluation.",
        "gaps": "Keyed PERMIT (the clause's effect is to permit the four types). It also sets precedence over the Chapter 900 exception regulations 900.1.10(3) and 900.1.10(4)(A) (a site-specific exception's narrower list of building types does not remove these permissions); ranks_layers is reserved for PROCEDURAL units so it is not keyed here. The minor-variance alternative is not evaluated."
